%% Title: Data flow · demo population and retention
%% Summary: The demo fallback path (fictional posts through the real scorers, labelled DEMO end to end) and the retention flows run by the worker's maintenance jobs: text removal by blanking (platform-terms windows, the Reddit deletion re-check, the detail window), the demo purge, monthly compaction and the source_runs rollup.
%% Sources: scripts/populate.js, scripts/standup.sh, docker-compose.yml (populate, collector settings), src/config/data-mode.js, src/config/source-registry.js (retentionHours, sourceStatus), src/workers/maintenance.worker.js, src/workers/start.js, src/collectors/retention.js, src/collectors/run-retention.js, src/collectors/reddit/{maintenance,recheck}.js, scripts/compact.js; migrations 005, 025, 031, 034, 039. Spec: TECHNICAL_SPEC.md section 19 (layered retention); ADR 0001 ruling 9; PR #22 decisions G3, G4, G5.
flowchart LR

  subgraph DEMO["Demo population · scripts/populate.js"]
    direction TB
    M1["standup: populate --once<br/>(populate container, collector settings only)<br/>one real collection job, triggered_by standup;<br/>no API keys, so only routes that need none;<br/>a gated route also needs GATE_APPROVED_BY"]:::done
    M2{"trailing hour holds<br/>live posts (and no --force)?"}:::done
    M3["demo batch (--force always writes one)"]:::done
    M9{"--once, no --force: hour already holds<br/>--size demo posts, no live posts and<br/>collection unavailable? (checked first)"}:::done
    M4["populate --loop (profile demo)<br/>every DEMO_FEED_INTERVAL_MS (150 s):<br/>DEMO_FEED_BATCH posts (default 16,<br/>two per category) only while the hour has no live posts"]:::done
    M5["fictional posts: text starts with [Demo],<br/>raw_payload demo: true, fictional: true,<br/>under data_sources demo_#lt;category#gt;<br/>(source_type demo, active false)"]:::done
    M6["normalisePost → raw_posts (collected_at = now)<br/>→ saveSentiment / saveRelevance / saveDQI<br/>with audit rows → runBiasChecks<br/>→ embed jobs only when embeddings are enabled and<br/>the service is ready (standup otherwise passes --no-embed;<br/>a later --once backfills the hour); processing_jobs triggered_by demo"]:::done
    M7["labelled on the way out: data_mode on /api/health,<br/>demo_posts + data_mode per city row,<br/>data_origin on receipts → DEMO kicker,<br/>Demo data markers, demo receipt wording"]:::done
    M8["no demo post written;<br/>the page reads LIVE"]:::done
    M10["collection and batch skipped; only missing<br/>demo embeddings are backfilled"]:::done
    M1 --> M9
    M9 -- yes --> M10
    M9 -- no --> M2
    M2 -- yes --> M8
    M2 -- no --> M3 --> M5
    M4 --> M2
    M5 --> M6 --> M7
  end

  subgraph TEXT["Text retention · job 'retention', 5 min"]
    direction TB
    R1["worker: blankExpired() for every real source,<br/>whatever the gate (MAINTENANCE_EVERY_MS, 5 min);<br/>window per source: Reddit 48 h; YouTube, TikTok<br/>30 days (by analogy); every other source, the<br/>Guardian included, RETENTION_DETAIL_DAYS (90)"]:::done
    R2["Reddit timer: recheckDeletions() every 6 h<br/>via /api/info, only while Reddit's gate is open"]:::done
    R3["raw_posts.content (NOT NULL) and payload text keys<br/>→ the source's removal notice (never nulled);<br/>url removed (Reddit: slug-less permalink);<br/>text_removed_at, text_removed_reason set"]:::done
    R6["platform-terms window or upstream deletion:<br/>post_embeddings of the posts deleted in the<br/>same transaction (G3); detail window:<br/>embeddings left to compaction"]:::done
    R4["kept: row, external id, provenance fingerprint,<br/>content hash, every score and audit row"]:::done
    R5["one data_retention_log row per batch:<br/>blanked_platform_terms or<br/>text_removed_detail_window"]:::done
    R1 -- "window ended" --> R3
    R2 -- "deleted or removed upstream" --> R3
    R3 --> R6
    R3 --> R4
    R3 --> R5
  end

  subgraph COMPACT["Compaction · job 'daily'"]
    direction TB
    P1["scripts/compact.js (also npm run compact)<br/>demo purge first: demo posts older than<br/>RETENTION_DETAIL_DAYS (90) deleted in batches<br/>(DEMO_PURGE_BATCH_SIZE, 500) with their score,<br/>audit, embedding and sighting rows;<br/>data_retention_log action purged_demo"]:::done
    P2["each calendar month that ended before the<br/>cutoff, with real posts, not yet in compaction_log,<br/>one transaction per month →<br/>monthly_topic_rollups + monthly_source_rollups<br/>(demo posts excluded)"]:::done
    P4["remove any text still stored<br/>(the same blanking, never nulled)"]:::done
    P3["delete post_embeddings of the month"]:::done
    P5["one data_retention_log row compacted,<br/>one compaction_log row"]:::done
    P6["same daily job: source_runs older than 30 days<br/>→ source_run_daily, then removed<br/>(rolled_up_source_runs); processing_jobs<br/>are never removed (G4)"]:::done
    P1 --> P2 --> P4 --> P3 --> P5
    P5 ~~~ P6
  end

  subgraph LEGEND["Status legend"]
    L1["all done (every element is on master)"]:::done
  end

